# Keep build context lean and avoid bringing host-built dist/ into the
# container (which then collides with the in-container tsc -b output:
# TS5055 "Cannot write file because it would overwrite input file").
**/dist
**/.tsbuildinfo
**/node_modules
.git
.claude
**/coverage
**/cdk.out
**/cdk.out.*
**/.next
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/tests-out
**/storybook-static
.DS_Store
*.log
